<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-NZ 72 WITHOUT LOSS VS ENGLAND AT LUNCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NZ 72 WITHOUT LOSS VS ENGLAND AT LUNCH.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand were 72 without loss at lunch after being put into bat by England on the opening day of the first test in Auckland on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>New Zealand 72-0 (B. Young 37 not out, B. Pocock 25 not out).</p>
